{
  "title": "Solo Leveling",
  "description": "In a world where awakened beings called “Hunters” must battle deadly monsters to protect humanity, Sung Jinwoo, nicknamed “the weakest hunter of all mankind,” finds himself in a constant struggle for survival. One day, after a brutal encounter in an overpowered dungeon wipes out his party and threatens to end his life, a mysterious System chooses him as its sole player: Jinwoo has been granted the rare opportunity to level up his abilities, possibly beyond any known limits. Follow Jinwoo’s journey as he takes on ever-stronger enemies, both human and monster, to discover the secrets deep within the dungeons and the ultimate extent of his powers.\n\n*Source: Tappytoon*\n\n---\n\nKnown as the Weakest Hunter of All Mankind, E-rank hunter Jinwoo Sung’s contribution to raids amounts to trying not to get killed. Unfortunately, between his mother’s hospital bills, his sister’s tuition, and his own lack of job prospects, he has no choice but to continue to put his life on the line. So when an opportunity arises for a bigger payout, he takes it…only to come face-to-face with a being whose power outranks anything he’s ever seen! With the party leader missing an arm and the only healer a quivering mess, can Jinwoo some­how find them a way out?\n\n*Source: Yen Press, Vol. 1*\n\nStatus: completed\nTags: 21st century, Action, Adventure, Anti-Hero, Assassins, Creature Taming, Demons, Drama, Fantasy, Foreign, Guilds, Healer, Lucky Protagonist, Necromancer, Overpowered Male Lead, Politics, Poor to Rich, Post-Apocalyptic, Primarily Adult Cast, Rivalry, Ruthless Protagonist, Shounen, Smart Male Lead, Strong Male Lead, Stubborn Male Lead, Tragedy, Video Games, Adapted to Anime, Adapted to Game, Adult Cast, Adult-Teenager Relationship, Based on a Novel, Based on a Web Novel, Celebrity, Character Growth, Coming of Age, Contemporary Fantasy, Cool Male Lead, Crimes, Dark Fantasy, Demon Girl, Detectives, Dungeon, Dungeon Exploring, Earth Invasion, Elaborate, Ensemble Cast, Family, Fantasy World, Father-Son Relationship, Full Color, Game Elements, Gary Stu, God-Human Relationship, Gore, Hair Style Change, Handsome Male Lead, Hard-Working Protagonist, Heterosexual, Horror, Hunter, Korean Folklore, Level System, Life-Changing Events, Longstrip, Magic, Magical/Spiritual Power Ranking, Male Lead, Male Protagonist, Manhwa, Married Couple, Married Female Lead, Modern Era, Monsters, Monsters Invade Earth, Murder, Necromancy, Overpowered Protagonist, Parallel World, Personality Change, Protective Male Lead, Rescue, Revival, Romantic Subplot, Saving the World, Scars, Skills, South Korea, Strategic Male Lead, Strong-Willed Male Lead, Subtle Romance, Super Powers, Swordplay, Tragic Past, Urban Fantasy, Violence, Weak Male Lead, Weak to Strong, Web Comic, Adult Character, Adult couple, Adult Female Lead, Adult Male Lead, Adult Protagonist, Alliance, Badass Male Lead, Badass Protagonist, Brother-Sister Relationship, Coma, Dragons, Fearless Male Lead, Godly Powers, Guild Master, Inherited Power, Invincible Protagonist, Large Scale Battles, Marriage, Mother, Muscular Male Lead, Muscular Protagonist, Observant Male Lead, Observant Protagonist, Older Brother, Pragmatic Male Lead, Pyrokinesis, Ruthless Male Lead, Seeing Things Other Humans Can't, Sick Family Member, Sick Parent, Sisters, Snowscape, Strong Character, Suits, System, Telekinesis, Training, Violent Character, Younger Sister",
